{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_48932","headline":"望岳时贼据华夏 · 唐彦谦","name":"望岳时贼据华夏","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"长路风埃隔楚氛，忽惊神岳映朝曛。\n削成绝壁五千仞，高揖泥金七十君。\n祝史秘辞今莫睹，从臣嘉颂久无闻。\n幽人闲望封中地，好爲吾皇起白云。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"唐彦谦","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_48932.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_48932","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}